{"version":1,"key":"card:148","content":{"id":148,"content":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"e4240719-dda9-4652-a593-4c3675601882","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"在复杂的网页应用中，DOM 结构会频繁的发生变化，有的时候我们需要根据变化来进行相应的操作，以往通过 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"Mutation Events"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 来监听 DOM 的变化，目前它已经废弃了，被 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"MutationObserver"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 所取代。"},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"MutationObserver"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 的兼容性很好，可以放心大胆的使用。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"422aa781-5b35-4ad7-8549-7367ae247ab3","children":[{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"MutationObserver"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 的基本用法如下"}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"JavaScript","uuid":"dc7acd5e-7f39-4a6c-84b2-7f1a0a65756d","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"28f12efe-3077-472d-bd2c-8c54cf04c7cf","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":"const observer = new MutationObserver(mutations => {\n\n});\nobserver.observe(element, options);","collabId":"16c0baad-a564-41a1-88b6-692d327a1029","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"5939acd2-5bd4-4efb-a983-e112cc8b61dc","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"我们通过 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"new MutationObserver()"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 创建一个 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"MutationObserver"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 对象，构造函数接收一个回调函数作为参数，当被监听的元素 DOM 发生变化时，该回调函数将会执行。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"542e2732-34b5-4c8f-bcd9-f778c8ec791b","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"回调函数接收一个参数，该参数是一个数组，其中元素类型为 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"MutationRecord"},{"type":"formatted","text":"，"},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"MutationRecord"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 包含如下属性："}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"JavaScript","uuid":"86975705-43ea-491b-8597-6dfd1760920e","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"cad14ba5-abc1-41d5-80d2-9112b9df65be","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":"{\n\ttype: 'attributes',\n\ttarget: div#container,\n\taddedNodes: [],\n\tremoveNodes: [],\n\tpreviousSibling: null,\n\tnextSibling: null,\n\tattributeName: '',\n\tattributeNamespace: null,\n\toldValue: ''\n}","collabId":"de59034e-7c00-4a28-92f7-a48d50700f87","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"b6baa53e-a1d9-4a72-9e0a-f37ef24085b2","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"通过 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"observe(element, options)"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 对元素 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"element"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 进行监听，除了需要传入要监听的元素以外，还需要传递一个 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"options"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 对象，它包括如下字段："}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"JavaScript","uuid":"09e5e397-b463-43a4-8974-30c7a1fa007f","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"1d8fa357-7926-44fe-87ef-021a3a389d54","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":"{\n\tchildList: true,\n\tattributes: true,\n\tattributeFilter: ['class', 'style'],\n\tattributeOldValue: true,\n\tcharacterData: true,\n\tcharacterDataOldValue: true,\n\tsubtree: true\n}","collabId":"6eac8c68-5c6f-4ab2-a530-92090533d5c2","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"7975a98c-e726-493f-afd0-ba10298551cf","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"这里为了完整性将可设置的所有参数列了出来，实际在 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"options"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 参数并不需要指定每一个属性。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"35377bd9-b96f-49ad-bbe3-d797c6f33da7","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"可以观察到除了 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"attributeFilter"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 属性外，其它属性都是布尔值，也就说这些属性相当于一个开关，设置某个属性为 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"true"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 就相当于开启某个特性，后面会详细介绍每个属性的作用。"}]},{"type":"callout","calloutType":"note","title":"","tauContract":"82a3e58fc7df817d12ed2ff5fb675ef0d468689701d99d9471018c2dbd8a3221","collabId":"c2daf4aa-6b76-44ea-9171-f1a710709f51","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"c57b8757-1534-46fe-b3ea-c323e29cacef","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"虽然不需要指定每一个属性，但是 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"childList"},{"type":"formatted","text":", "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"attributes"},{"type":"formatted","text":", "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"characterData"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 这三个属性必须有一个设置为 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"true"},{"type":"formatted","text":"。"}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"d6372da8-0713-4289-a5c1-f3cb525e576c","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"如果不再需要监听 DOM 的变化时，可以通过 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"observer.disconnect()"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 方法停止监听。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"45855022-fdf8-4950-b956-ff0eb699cc52","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"举个🌰："}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"html","uuid":"1a21a850-cf49-4701-98bf-828106b1ba20","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"8bbb9742-4dc2-41bd-a973-952fa35fcb63","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":"<div id=\"container\">\n  <p>世界这么大，我想去看看</p>\n</div>\n<button id=\"btn\">删除元素</button>","collabId":"d6693af0-becd-464c-8a13-c597dbc827c7","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"JavaScript","uuid":"4e9cf2ae-cf10-448d-96e9-d07bd7a8a9e8","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"fbb18bdb-b1bb-4dc1-8ee7-989e7feb4cd9","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":"const observer = new MutationObserver(mutations => {\n  console.log(mutations);\n});\nobserver.observe(document.getElementById('container'), {\n  childList: true\n});\n\nconst btn = document.getElementById('btn');\nbtn.addEventListener('click', () => {\n  document.getElementById('container').removeChild(\n    document.querySelector('#container p')\n  );\n});","collabId":"4e971ff2-7530-4799-aa39-5a89b2400cd1","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"e8b7c573-0575-4595-ad44-21292678554a","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"页面中有一个 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"id"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 为 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"container"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 的元素，其中有一个 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"p"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 标签， "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"p"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 标签中其中包含一些文字。页面中还有一个按钮，当点击按钮时，会将 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"p"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 标签从 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"container"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 中移除。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"fbee9e87-fbf3-47f9-ac41-c35591042b63","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"现在我们创建一个 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"MutationObserver"},{"type":"formatted","text":"，并监听了 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"container"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 元素，设置 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"options"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 中的 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"childList"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 为 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"true"},{"type":"formatted","text":"，表示当 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"container"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 的子节点发生变化时（新增或删除），将会被监听到，从而触发回调函数的执行。在回调函数中，我们只是简单的打印了回调函数的参数。"}]},{"type":"callout","calloutType":"info","title":"","tauContract":"82a3e58fc7df817d12ed2ff5fb675ef0d468689701d99d9471018c2dbd8a3221","collabId":"42b075aa-b049-475f-8e50-94bad7eeea89","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"7d16d445-2340-4af5-86e2-9b6b81ecc501","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"通过 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"MutationObserver"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 可以监视到三种 DOM 变化："}]},{"type":"numbered-list","tauContract":"3a3b4d6f4d2098952ffe3c6e00baedd170e840beb6fb5fc715467ae5845e0156","collabId":"278aca54-3b59-49a1-9815-0d04b31612f4","children":[{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"55cba991-39b7-4c0b-be41